                                                "sense_id": "d4bfbd8a-d6dc-3d93-8fbd-7f70825fa4e6",
                                                "text": "Nor certainly is Pindar blind to the more pathetic aspects of humanity—its transitoriness, its sorrows, its ignorance, its moral frailty[…]"
